1
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,840
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,980
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,300
=Episode 14=

4
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:51,310
Su.

5
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,190
You've finally married me.

6
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:57,830
Here in Jiyun Pavilion,

7
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,420
I'm not the Emperor,

8
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:01,270
and you're not a Noble Lady.

9
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:03,380
You can call me like you used to.

10
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,230
Call me Mr. Gu...

11
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:07,100
No.

12
00:01:07,990 --> 00:01:09,310
Call me Che.

13
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:13,500
Che.

14
00:01:19,030 --> 00:01:19,830
What happened to your hand?

15
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:21,340
Did Consort Chen pick on you again?

16
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:22,860
It's nothing.

17
00:01:23,470 --> 00:01:25,630
I lost my grip while serving tea

18
00:01:26,110 --> 00:01:26,830
and burned my hand.

19
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:28,940
You say nothing when you're wronged,

20
00:01:29,910 --> 00:01:31,580
yet you're quick to cover for others.

21
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:33,420
I'm not covering for anyone.

22
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:36,780
I just don't want to put you
in a difficult position.

23
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:45,470
As for this,

24
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:47,390
I'll make this right for you.

25
00:02:00,030 --> 00:02:01,550
He spends every night with her.

26
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,500
Seven nights straight.

27
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:07,860
Over one little red mark on her hand,

28
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:10,630
His Majesty

29
00:02:11,220 --> 00:02:13,580
scolded me in front of everyone,

30
00:02:14,510 --> 00:02:15,580
calling me jealous

31
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:17,460
and harsh.

32
00:02:19,110 --> 00:02:21,390
After all these years by his side,

33
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:24,830
I'm still no match for a village woman.

34
00:02:26,230 --> 00:02:27,110
Please calm down, Your Highness.

35
00:02:27,790 --> 00:02:29,510
His Majesty is smitten with her now.

36
00:02:29,830 --> 00:02:30,790
We can't confront him head-on.

37
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:32,900
So I'm supposed to tolerate her

38
00:02:33,390 --> 00:02:34,830
until she walks all over me?

39
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:39,070
Your Highness.

40
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:41,110
I know of a place

41
00:02:41,830 --> 00:02:43,300
where we can get rid of her

42
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:44,860
without getting our hands dirty.

43
00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:46,180
Tell me.

44
00:02:46,830 --> 00:02:48,620
Do you remember Mufang Pool?

45
00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:50,900
It was reserved for the late Empress.

46
00:02:51,230 --> 00:02:52,580
After she passed away,

47
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,550
His Majesty ordered it sealed at once.

48
00:02:54,830 --> 00:02:56,230
No one is allowed inside.

49
00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:57,350
At best, trespassers

50
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:59,140
are sent to the Cold Palace.

51
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:00,860
At worst, they're put to death.

52
00:03:01,670 --> 00:03:03,620
We only need to lure that wretch inside,

53
00:03:04,270 --> 00:03:06,070
time it with the patrol,

54
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,740
and have the guards catch her there.

55
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:10,110
Then no one can say you harmed her.

56
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:11,300
She'll simply have

57
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:12,620
brought it on herself.

58
00:03:15,390 --> 00:03:16,140
Good.

59
00:03:16,950 --> 00:03:17,830
But

60
00:03:18,580 --> 00:03:21,670
Mufang Pool is near West Buddhist Hall.

61
00:03:22,270 --> 00:03:24,620
Prince Ning is on retreat there.

62
00:03:26,070 --> 00:03:27,140
Keep it quiet.

63
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:28,790
Don't let anyone find out.

64
00:03:29,830 --> 00:03:30,830
Don't worry, Your Highness.

65
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:32,740
Only the patrol guards will catch her.

66
00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:34,550
We won't alert anyone
at West Buddhist Hall.

67
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:38,510
Su Cao.

68
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:42,740
Let's see how you escape this time.

69
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:48,020
(Lishui Pavilion)

70
00:03:51,830 --> 00:03:52,900
No need for formalities, Su Cao.

71
00:03:53,350 --> 00:03:53,900
How are you?

72
00:03:54,180 --> 00:03:55,700
I heard you've caught a cold.

73
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,270
Has the imperial physician
taken your pulse?

74
00:03:57,550 --> 00:03:57,950
Come.

75
00:03:58,140 --> 00:03:58,740
Sit down.

76
00:04:00,350 --> 00:04:01,740
Thank you for your concern, Consort Shu.

77
00:04:02,020 --> 00:04:02,950
It's only a minor illness.

78
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,950
Even a minor illness needs attention.

79
00:04:06,950 --> 00:04:09,140
There's a hot spring in the palace
that's wonderfully restorative.

80
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:10,489
A soak in that pool

81
00:04:10,531 --> 00:04:11,670
will chase off the chill.

82
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:19,510
I wouldn't dare trouble you.

83
00:04:19,670 --> 00:04:20,990
Don't say that, Su Cao.

84
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:23,500
His Majesty dotes on you now.

85
00:04:23,990 --> 00:04:25,159
You need to stay healthy

86
00:04:25,201 --> 00:04:27,030
so you can serve him for years to come.

87
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:29,300
As his consorts,

88
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:30,740
isn't everything we do for him?

89
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:33,790
Since you brought His Majesty into it,

90
00:04:34,990 --> 00:04:36,860
I suppose I can't refuse.

91
00:04:37,670 --> 00:04:38,550
That's better.

92
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:39,180
Come.

93
00:04:40,260 --> 00:04:40,710
Let's go.

94
00:04:41,590 --> 00:04:42,470
I'll take you there.

95
00:04:42,990 --> 00:04:43,500
Wanniang.

96
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:44,350
Qing'er.

97
00:04:44,740 --> 00:04:45,550
You go back first.

98
00:04:46,910 --> 00:04:47,260
Mm.

99
00:04:48,910 --> 00:04:49,300
Let's go.

100
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:53,280
(Lishui Pavilion)

101
00:05:05,380 --> 00:05:06,110
It's done?

102
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:07,470
Your Highness.

103
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,230
Consort Shu...

104
00:05:09,990 --> 00:05:10,860
is dead.

105
00:05:21,670 --> 00:05:22,790
Your Majesty.

106
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:25,300
Consort Shu drank too much

107
00:05:25,550 --> 00:05:27,420
and soaked in the hot spring.

108
00:05:27,710 --> 00:05:28,740
Her blood vessels dilated in the heat,

109
00:05:28,910 --> 00:05:30,670
triggering a heart attack.

110
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:31,940
She drowned.

111
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:34,180
That wretch.

112
00:05:35,110 --> 00:05:37,860
How dare she taint Roujia's Mufang Pool.

113
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:39,940
Have it thoroughly cleaned.

114
00:05:42,790 --> 00:05:43,260
Yes.

115
00:05:44,150 --> 00:05:44,860
Then...

116
00:05:45,710 --> 00:05:47,060
what about Consort Shu?

117
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:50,300
She trespassed on forbidden ground.

118
00:05:50,470 --> 00:05:51,620
She deserved to die.

119
00:05:52,230 --> 00:05:53,300
Strip her of her rank.

120
00:05:54,150 --> 00:05:55,550
Do not bury her in the imperial tombs.

121
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,260
Understood.

122
00:06:01,350 --> 00:06:01,940
Your Majesty.

123
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:05,380
Consort Shu was Consort Chen's ally.

124
00:06:06,940 --> 00:06:08,060
Could this

125
00:06:08,470 --> 00:06:09,710
be connected to...?

126
00:06:12,670 --> 00:06:13,740
I know.

127
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:17,030
She died here.

128
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:19,060
It was Heaven's will.

129
00:06:22,470 --> 00:06:23,110
Yes.

130
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:27,500
Su Cao.

131
00:06:27,710 --> 00:06:28,590
This is the place.

132
00:06:29,150 --> 00:06:30,300
Go on. Take a soak.

133
00:06:30,910 --> 00:06:32,359
It'll chase off your cold

134
00:06:32,401 --> 00:06:33,380
in no time.

135
00:06:35,790 --> 00:06:36,620
It's huge.

136
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:40,420
What?

137
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:41,550
Never seen one this big?

138
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:44,260
I...

139
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:46,710
I've never bathed in a pool this large.

140
00:06:47,150 --> 00:06:48,260
I'm a little nervous.

141
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:51,990
Consort Shu.

142
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:56,260
Could you help me to the edge?

143
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:58,590
Of course.

144
00:06:58,790 --> 00:06:59,670
I'll help you.

145
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:33,490
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

146
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:37,690
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

147
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:40,930
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

148
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:43,000
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

149
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:46,900
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

150
00:07:47,730 --> 00:07:50,890
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

151
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:55,250
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

152
00:07:56,170 --> 00:07:58,500
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

153
00:07:58,550 --> 00:08:00,680
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

154
00:08:00,860 --> 00:08:03,930
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

155
00:08:04,930 --> 00:08:08,080
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

156
00:08:09,670 --> 00:08:13,130
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

157
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,960
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

158
00:08:16,710 --> 00:08:20,310
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

159
00:08:21,770 --> 00:08:24,900
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

160
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:30,130
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

161
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:38,380
♪The past has faded away♪

162
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:42,480
♪The past has faded away♪
